{
    "name": "戶外活動",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，<br>討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！"
            },
            {
                "text": "Pani, tarasangara taniara nura, tia kasu mukusa nanu?",
                "textCh": "Pani，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919404",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "nura, tia ku maracocua mataa Pi’i mukusa cakʉran cumacapa ’aramʉ. makananu ikasu?",
                "textCh": "我明天要和Pi’i去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919405",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "makai manʉng timanʉʉn! tʉni kara ku kipapa?",
                "textCh": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919406",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "mata’urua pa kasu kesoni cina.",
                "textCh": "你先問媽媽！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919407",
                "image": "boy-2.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "cina, tʉni kara ku kipapa kana’ua mukusa cakʉran?",
                "textCh": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919408",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "tʉni, nakai matangiria kamu!",
                "textCh": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
                "sound": "text/sound/71668/998407",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-3.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ʉʉ’ʉ, tia kim matangiri.",
                "textCh": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
                "sound": "text/sound/65786/919410",
                "image": "boy-1.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            }
        ],
